[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336520007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4336520007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4336520007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAnoLRw","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T15:03:19Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T15:03:59Z","body":"If you keep editing the next line and then go back, it’ll jump to the previous line. I’m not sure if this is a proper fix. Might need some polishing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336520007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336636395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4336636395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4336636395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAnvR6w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T15:17:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T15:17:39Z","body":"The 10 line threshold was supposed to prevent adding every single line to navigation history. The position should be recorded only when you click more than 10 lines away from the current line.\r\n\r\nI was suspecting this was the cause. The threshold should only apply when clicking to move the caret and should be ignored when jumping to definition.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336636395/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336770243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4336770243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4336770243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAn3cww","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T15:34:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T15:34:42Z","body":"Yes, that makes sense. I’ll retain the threshold and add a few additional conditions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336770243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4338469168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4338469168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4338469168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABApfJMA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T19:34:59Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T19:35:30Z","body":"I did not see the original PR. But before you start adding more context parameters to the signal, just one quick thought:\r\n\r\nThe previous architecture (based on my understanding) around this (which was certainly not consistently applied) was, to call `_save_history` for explicit actions that always need to be recorded (e.g. symbol navigation). The call from the caret signal was only meant for users clicking somewhere (for which the threshold logic is meant). To prevent duplicated history entries, when the explicit jump triggered also a caret jump there exists a history locking mechanism.\r\n\r\nI'm wondering whether the original PR already did go into the wrong direction, since previously I was under the impression that all those bugs are caused by not correctly locking down the history in e.g. `ScriptEditor::edit`.\r\n\r\nThat's not to say the previous solution is great or couldn't be improved, but since the history locking is still in place as far as I can see, this series of PR's feels a bit as if we keep putting out fires were stuff falls apart, instead of looking at the big picture.\r\n\r\nDamn that got long :sweat: tl;dr Based on your understanding, which purpose does history locking serve?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4338469168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4340174779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4340174779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4340174779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABArHPuw","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T01:07:02Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T01:07:02Z","body":"Thanks for your feedback. I’ve double-checked my previous PR #116585.\r\n\r\nA major part of this PR #116585 is intended to ensure the editor scrolls to the correct position. It fixes an issue where the caret’s line and column coordinates were accurate, yet the correct viewport position was not visible to users.\r\n\r\nThe remaining changes in PR #116585 build upon the old state-saving logic inside `_on_caret_moved()`. Since the caret can be moved for a wide variety of reasons, many of these scenarios should not actually trigger history recording. That's why some of the fixes seem rather fragmented and piecemeal. But we may ultimately still have to rely on `_on_caret_moved()`, as certain history records do need to be merged or created when the caret moves.\r\n\r\nThese are just my initial ideas. New thoughts may come up once the actual coding work begins.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4340174779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4340384488","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4340384488","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4340384488,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABArUC6A","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T02:18:23Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T02:18:23Z","body":"> Based on your understanding, which purpose does history locking serve?\r\n\r\n- Explicit user navigation actions (e.g., go to definition, symbol jump, manual Ctrl+G triggering, editor switching): create a new history entry.\r\n- Caret movement within 10 lines in the same editor: update the existing history entry.\r\n- Caret movement spanning more than 10 lines: create a new history entry.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4340384488/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4340607467","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4340607467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4340607467,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABArhp6w","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T03:25:13Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T03:25:13Z","body":"I misunderstood the term \"locking\". I was probably completely unaware of this locking mechanism (the `lock_history` property in ScriptEditor). My initial instinct was that things shouldn’t be this complicated. Another thought: could this complex situation stem from the fact that history entries are recorded upon leaving a position, rather than when entering it? I still need to look into this further.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4340607467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4365417238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4365417238","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4365417238,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBDL7Fg","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-03T04:50:12Z","updated_at":"2026-05-03T04:50:12Z","body":"I'm sorry but I have to refactor the history system.\r\nThe new workflow is to explicitly allow the in-depth editor or help documentation to record a new state via a specific action.\r\n```\r\nInput::get_singleton()->action_press(SNAME(\"_navigation_action\"));\r\ndo_something();\r\nInput::get_singleton()->action_release(SNAME(\"_navigation_action\"));\r\n```\r\nThe old approach of simultaneously saving both jump-from position and jump-in position to the history has also been discarded.\r\nThe new workflow is more controllable and clearer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4365417238/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4389681064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4389681064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4389681064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBaU3qA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_