","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T01:51:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T01:53:12Z","body":"> There's some new bug. In the MRP from the issue:\r\n> \r\n> 1. Ctrl + Click on `far()` call\r\n> 2. Go back\r\n> 3. Caret is at line 6\r\n> 4. Click the comment line (17)\r\n> 5. Go back\r\n> \r\n> Expected: caret is at line 6 again. Actual: caret skips line 6 and goes back to wherever the caret was before that.\r\n\r\nThanks. Fixed.\r\n\r\nAlso fixed:\r\n1. If you drag the mouse backward to select text, go to somewhere and then come back, the backward text selection becomes a forward selection.\r\n2. Go back in editor_help at a wrong position.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4393542679/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744918886","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119047#issuecomment-4744918886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119047","id":4744918886,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGtG3Zg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use